    Kafka->>NC: Consume OrderCreatedEvent { orderId, userId, items, totalAmount }

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over NC, DB: Bước 1: Idempotency Check
        NC->>DB: findByOrderIdAndType(orderId, ORDER_CREATED)
